I'm trying to exchange data between server and client

The `server code` is the taken from here: https://github.com/mas-bandwidth/netcode/blob/main/server.c : 

    #include <string>
    #include "../include/netcode.h"
    #include <stdio.h>
    #include <string.h>
    #include <assert.h>
